OL,3,GNEWSABarbican Conservatory offers 2,000
OL,4,Afree cuttings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Barbican Conservatory is offering
OL,7,Ffree plant cuttings to the public,
OL,8,Fahead of its three-year closure for
OL,9,Frestoration in January.
OL,11,FMore than 2,000 plant cuttings will be
OL,12,Favailable to people who have booked
OL,13,Fonline on Wednesday, with two more
OL,14,Fopportunities to collect plants
OL,15,Fscheduled later in the year.
OL,17,FThe Grade II listed arts venue is to
OL,18,Fundergo a #231m overhaul, including the
OL,19,Fdevelopment of a climate-controlled
OL,20,Fhabitat to support plant health.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
