OL,3,GNEWSABarbican Conservatory offers 2,000
OL,4,Afree cuttings
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarbican chief operating officer Dr
OL,7,FPhilippa Simpson said the conservatory
OL,8,Frestoration was focused on "creating a
OL,9,Fhealthier home for plants and enabling
OL,10,Fmore people to enjoy the environment
OL,11,Fand the activities it will host".
